</head><body><a class="skip-link" href="#main-content">Skip to main content</a><header class="site-header" data-site-header><div class="site-header__inner shell"><a class="brand-link" href="/" aria-label="NovaDot home"><img class="brand-logo" src="/brand/novadot-full-logo-footer-transparent.png" srcset="/brand/novadot-full-logo-footer-transparent.png 1x, /brand/novadot-full-logo-footer-transparent-2x.png 2x" width="720" height="280" alt="NovaDot"></a><nav class="desktop-nav" aria-label="Primary navigation"><a href="/" aria-current="page">Home</a><a href="/services/">Services</a><a href="/events/">Events &amp; Space</a><a href="/how-we-work/">How We Work</a><a href="/about/">About</a></nav><a class="button button--primary header-cta" href="/contact/">Discuss your project</a><button class="menu-toggle" type="button" aria-label="Open navigation menu" aria-controls="mobile-navigation" aria-expanded="false" data-menu-toggle><span aria-hidden="true"></span><span aria-hidden="true"></span><span aria-hidden="true"></span></button></div></header><nav id="mobile-navigation" class="mobile-nav" aria-label="Mobile navigation" hidden data-mobile-nav><div class="shell mobile-nav__inner"><a href="/" aria-current="page">Home</a><a href="/services/">Services</a><div class="mobile-nav__services" role="group" aria-label="Service areas"><a href="/services/software-ai-business-systems/">Software, AI &amp; Business Systems</a><a href="/services/web-mobile-digital-growth/">Web, Mobile &amp; Digital Growth</a><a href="/services/cloud-security-it-operations/">Cloud, Security &amp; IT Operations</a></div><a href="/events/">Events &amp; Space</a><a href="/how-we-work/">How We Work</a><a href="/about/">About</a><a href="/contact/">Contact</a><a class="button button--primary" href="/contact/">Discuss your project</a></div></nav><script type="module">var e=document.querySelector(`[data-menu-toggle]`),t=document.querySelector(`[data-mobile-nav]`);if(e instanceof HTMLButtonElement&&t instanceof HTMLElement){let n=[document.querySelector(`.skip-link`),document.querySelector(`main`),document.querySelector(`footer`)].filter(e=>e instanceof HTMLElement),r=e=>{n.forEach(t=>{t.inert=e})},i=(n=!1)=>{let i=e.getAttribute(`aria-expanded`)===`true`;e.setAttribute(`aria-expanded`,`false`),e.setAttribute(`aria-label`,`Open navigation menu`),t.hidden=!0,document.body.classList.remove(`menu-open`),r(!1),n&&i&&e.focus()};e.addEventListener(`click`,()=>{let n=e.getAttribute(`aria-expanded`)!==`true`;e.setAttribute(`aria-expanded`,String(n)),e.setAttribute(`aria-label`,n?`Close navigation menu`:`Open navigation menu`),t.hidden=!n,document.body.classList.toggle(`menu-open`,n),r(n)}),t.querySelectorAll(`a`).forEach(e=>e.addEventListener(`click`,()=>i())),document.addEventListener(`keydown`,n=>{if(n.key===`Escape`&&i(!0),n.key===`Tab`&&e.getAttribute(`aria-expanded`)===`true`){let r=[e,...t.querySelectorAll(`a`)],i=r[0],a=r.at(-1);n.shiftKey&&document.activeElement===i?(n.preventDefault(),a?.focus()):!n.shiftKey&&document.activeElement===a&&(n.preventDefault(),i.focus())}}),window.matchMedia(`(min-width: 960px)`).addEventListener(`change`,e=>{e.matches&&i()})}</script><main id="main-content"><section class="hero"><div class="hero__mesh" aria-hidden="true"></div><div class="shell hero__inner"><div class="hero__copy"><p class="hero__eyebrow"><span aria-hidden="true"></span>Software, AI, cloud &amp; digital delivery</p><h1><span>Make business</span><span class="hero__accent">technology work</span><span>better.</span></h1><p class="hero__lead">NovaDot helps UK organisations plan, build, improve and support the software, systems and digital services they rely on.</p><div class="hero__actions"><a class="button button--primary" href="/contact/">Discuss your project</a></div><ul class="hero__proof-list" aria-label="NovaDot company facts"><li>Active UK company</li><li>Incorporated 4 July 2011</li><li>Registered office: Leicester</li></ul></div><div class="hero__visual" aria-label="NovaDot delivery approach: diagnose, decide and deliver"><div class="signal-card"><div class="signal-card__header"><div class="signal-card__title"><span class="signal-card__mark" aria-hidden="true"></span><span>NovaDot delivery map</span></div><span class="signal-card__status">Practical by design</span></div><div class="signal-flow"><article class="signal-step signal-step--problem"><span class="signal-step__number">01 · Diagnose</span><strong>Where is the friction?</strong><p>Workflow · data · risk</p></article><span class="signal-connector" aria-hidden="true"></span><article class="signal-step signal-step--decision"><span class="signal-step__number">02 · Decide</span><strong>What is justified?</strong><p>Repair · integrate · build</p></article><span class="signal-connector" aria-hidden="true"></span><article class="signal-step signal-step--delivery"><span class="signal-step__number">03 · Deliver</span><strong>Make the change controlled.</strong><p>Scope · handover · support</p></article></div><div class="signal-outputs"><span>Clearer scope</span><span>Lower-risk route</span><span>Planned support</span></div></div></div></div><div class="trust-ledger"><div class="shell"><p><strong>One practical technology partner</strong></p><ul aria-label="Core capability areas"><li>Custom software</li><li>AI &amp; automation</li><li>Web &amp; mobile</li><li>Cloud &amp; IT operations</li></ul></div></div></section><section class="platform-ribbon" aria-labelledby="platform-ribbon-title" data-astro-cid-rjhr2dzn><div class="shell platform-ribbon__stack" data-astro-cid-rjhr2dzn><!-- Technology & Distribution Partners --><div class="platform-ribbon__card" data-astro-cid-rjhr2dzn><p id="platform-ribbon-title" class="platform-ribbon__eyebrow" data-astro-cid-rjhr2dzn>Platforms, cloud infrastructure &amp; distribution channels we configure and support</p><ul class="platform-ribbon__grid platform-ribbon__grid--platforms" role="list" data-astro-cid-rjhr2dzn><li class="platform-ribbon__item" title="Odoo · Business Systems &amp; ERP" data-astro-cid-rjhr2dzn><img src="/partners/odoo.svg" alt="Odoo logo" loading="lazy" decoding="async" width="600" height="191" style="height: 1.75rem;" data-astro-cid-rjhr2dzn></li><li class="platform-ribbon__item" title="Microsoft · Cloud &amp; Productivity" data-astro-cid-rjhr2dzn><img src="/partners/microsoft.svg" alt="Microsoft logo" loading="lazy" decoding="async" width="338" height="72" style="height: 1.35rem;" data-astro-cid-rjhr2dzn></li><li class="platform-ribbon__item" title="Google Cloud · Cloud &amp; Workspace" data-astro-cid-rjhr2dzn><img src="/partners/google.svg" alt="Google Cloud logo" loading="lazy" decoding="async" width="272" height="92" style="height: 1.45rem;" data-astro-cid-rjhr2dzn></li><li class="platform-ribbon__item" title="SiteGround · Managed Web Hosting" data-astro-cid-rjhr2dzn><img src="/partners/siteground.svg" alt="SiteGround logo" loading="lazy" decoding="async" width="225" height="75" style="height: 1.55rem;" data-astro-cid-rjhr2dzn></li><li class="platform-ribbon__item" title="OVHcloud · European Cloud Infrastructure" data-astro-cid-rjhr2dzn><img src="/partners/ovhcloud.svg" alt="OVHcloud logo" loading="lazy" decoding="async" width="298" height="47" style="height: 1.25rem;" data-astro-cid-rjhr2dzn></li><li class="platform-ribbon__item" title="TD SYNNEX · Technology Solutions Distribution" data-astro-cid-rjhr2dzn><img src="/partners/td-synnex.svg" alt="TD SYNNEX logo" loading="lazy" decoding="async" width="920" height="178" style="height: 1.35rem;" data-astro-cid-rjhr2dzn></li><li class="platform-ribbon__item" title="Ingram Micro · Global Technology Distribution" data-astro-cid-rjhr2dzn><img src="/partners/ingram-micro.svg" alt="Ingram Micro logo" loading="lazy" decoding="async" width="807" height="131" style="height: 1.25rem;" data-astro-cid-rjhr2dzn></li></ul></div><!-- Client Organisations & Delivery Partners --><div class="platform-ribbon__card" data-astro-cid-rjhr2dzn><p class="platform-ribbon__eyebrow" data-astro-cid-rjhr2dzn>Client organisations &amp; partners we work with</p><ul class="platform-ribbon__grid platform-ribbon__grid--clients" role="list" data-astro-cid-rjhr2dzn><li class="platform-ribbon__item" title="Sharman Fielding · Chartered Accountants" data-astro-cid-rjhr2dzn><img src="/clients/sharman-fielding.svg" alt="Sharman Fielding logo" loading="lazy" decoding="async" style="height: 2.1rem;" data-astro-cid-rjhr2dzn></li><li class="platform-ribbon__item" title="Neuro Grove · Neurological Care &amp; Therapy" data-astro-cid-rjhr2dzn><img src="/clients/neuro-grove.svg" alt="Neuro Grove logo" loading="lazy" decoding="async" style="height: 2.2rem;" data-astro-cid-rjhr2dzn></li><li class="platform-ribbon__item" title="Healthyaa · Health &amp; Wellness Platform" data-astro-cid-rjhr2dzn><img src="/clients/healthyaa.svg" alt="Healthyaa logo" loading="lazy" decoding="async" style="height: 1.8rem;" data-astro-cid-rjhr2dzn></li><li class="platform-ribbon__item" title="Rise Foundation · Charitable Foundation" data-astro-cid-rjhr2dzn><img src="/clients/rise-foundation.svg" alt="Rise Foundation logo" loading="lazy" decoding="async" style="height: 2.3rem;" data-astro-cid-rjhr2dzn></li><li class="platform-ribbon__item" title="Leicester Tamil Academy · Education &amp; Community" data-astro-cid-rjhr2dzn><img src="/clients/leicester-tamil-academy.svg" alt="Leicester Tamil Academy logo" loading="lazy" decoding="async" style="height: 2.3rem;" data-astro-cid-rjhr2dzn></li><li class="platform-ribbon__item" title="Akshayam · Confectionery &amp; Foods" data-astro-cid-rjhr2dzn><img src="/clients/akshayam.svg" alt="Akshayam logo" loading="lazy" decoding="async" style="height: 1.6rem;" data-astro-cid-rjhr2dzn></li><li class="platform-ribbon__item" title="Aspire Coco · Sustainable Agriculture" data-astro-cid-rjhr2dzn><img src="/clients/aspire-coco.svg" alt="Aspire Coco logo" loading="lazy" decoding="async" style="height: 2.2rem;" data-astro-cid-rjhr2dzn></li><li class="platform-ribbon__item" title="Speechtherapy with Ani · Clinical Speech Therapy" data-astro-cid-rjhr2dzn><img src="/clients/speechtherapy-ani.svg" alt="Speechtherapy with Ani logo" loading="lazy" decoding="async" style="height: 2.3rem;" data-astro-cid-rjhr2dzn></li><li class="platform-ribbon__item" title="Evolve Denim · Apparel &amp; Retail" data-astro-cid-rjhr2dzn><img src="/clients/evolve-denim.svg" alt="Evolve Denim logo" loading="lazy" decoding="async" style="height: 1.6rem;" data-astro-cid-rjhr2dzn></li><li class="platform-ribbon__item" title="Dakshin Restaurant · Hospitality &amp; Dining" data-astro-cid-rjhr2dzn><img src="/clients/dakshin.svg" alt="Dakshin Restaurant logo" loading="lazy" decoding="async" style="height: 2.3rem;" data-astro-cid-rjhr2dzn></li><li class="platform-ribbon__item" title="Global Aspire · Global Trade &amp; Sourcing" data-astro-cid-rjhr2dzn><img src="/clients/global-aspire.svg" alt="Global Aspire logo" loading="lazy" decoding="async" style="height: 2.2rem;" data-astro-cid-rjhr2dzn></li><li class="platform-ribbon__item" title="Psych Expert Witness · Medico-Legal Psychological Assessments" data-astro-cid-rjhr2dzn><img src="/clients/psych-expert-witness.svg" alt="Psych Expert Witness logo" loading="lazy" decoding="async" style="height: 2.3rem;" data-astro-cid-rjhr2dzn></li><li class="platform-ribbon__item" title="Ayurveda Herbal Clinic · Complementary Healthcare" data-astro-cid-rjhr2dzn><img src="/clients/ayurveda-herbal-clinic.svg" alt="Ayurveda Herbal Clinic logo" loading="lazy" decoding="async" style="height: 2.3rem;" data-astro-cid-rjhr2dzn></li></ul></div></div></section><section class="section home-services" id="services" aria-labelledby="services-title"><div class="shell"><div class="section-heading-grid"><div><p class="eyebrow">Technology services</p><h2 id="services-title">What would you like to improve?</h2></div><div class="section-heading__aside"><p>Choose the situation closest to yours. We can review what is happening, compare the options and agree a practical next step.</p><a class="text-link" href="/services/">Explore every service</a></div></div><div class="service-grid"><a class="service-card service-card--1" href="/services/software-ai-business-systems/"><div class="service-card__topline"><span>01</span><span>Business systems</span></div><div class="service-card__motif" aria-hidden="true"><span></span><span></span><span></span></div><h3>Manual work and disconnected systems</h3><p>Reduce re-keying, connect information and give teams a clearer view of the work moving through the business.</p><ul aria-label="Business systems capabilities"><li>Custom software</li><li>CRM, ERP &amp; Odoo</li><li>AI-assisted automation</li><li>Data integration</li></ul><span class="service-card__link">Explore software, AI and business systems<span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></span></a><a class="service-card service-card--2" href="/services/web-mobile-digital-growth/"><div class="service-card__topline"><span>02</span><span>Digital products</span></div><div class="service-card__motif" aria-hidden="true"><span></span><span></span><span></span></div><h3>A digital journey that is not performing</h3><p>Improve a website, mobile experience or customer journey that is slow, unclear, unreliable or difficult to measure.</p><ul aria-label="Digital products capabilities"><li>Websites &amp; CMS</li><li>Customer portals</li><li>Mobile experiences</li><li>Performance &amp; analytics</li></ul><span class="service-card__link">Explore web, mobile and digital growth<span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></span></a><a class="service-card service-card--3" href="/services/cloud-security-it-operations/"><div class="service-card__topline"><span>03</span><span>Technology operations</span></div><div class="service-card__motif" aria-hidden="true"><span></span><span></span><span></span></div><h3>Technology operations that feel uncertain</h3><p>Clarify ownership, resilience, cloud, backup, infrastructure and support when critical technology is difficult to control.</p><ul aria-label="Technology operations capabilities"><li>Cloud &amp; hosting</li><li>Backup &amp; recovery</li><li>IT operations</li><li>Application support</li></ul><span class="service-card__link">Explore cloud, security and IT operations<span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></span></a></div></div></section><section class="section diagnostic-section" id="diagnostic" aria-labelledby="diagnostic-title" data-astro-cid-ifa5x7jz><div class="shell" data-astro-cid-ifa5x7jz><div class="section-heading-grid" data-astro-cid-ifa5x7jz><div data-astro-cid-ifa5x7jz><p class="eyebrow" data-astro-cid-ifa5x7jz>Find a starting point</p><h2 id="diagnostic-title" data-astro-cid-ifa5x7jz>Explore a practical starting point.</h2></div><div class="section-heading__aside" data-astro-cid-ifa5x7jz><p data-astro-cid-ifa5x7jz>Answer two questions to explore a possible next step. We will need more detail before recommending a solution.</p></div></div><div class="diagnostic-card" data-diagnostic-root data-astro-cid-ifa5x7jz><!-- Step Navigation --><nav class="diagnostic-steps" aria-label="Diagnostic progress" data-astro-cid-ifa5x7jz><button type="button" class="diagnostic-step-indicator active" data-step-indicator="1" aria-current="step" data-astro-cid-ifa5x7jz><span class="step-num" data-astro-cid-ifa5x7jz>01</span><span class="step-label" data-astro-cid-ifa5x7jz>Identify need</span></button><button type="button" class="diagnostic-step-indicator" data-step-indicator="2" disabled data-astro-cid-ifa5x7jz><span class="step-num" data-astro-cid-ifa5x7jz>02</span><span class="step-label" data-astro-cid-ifa5x7jz>Current setup</span></button><button type="button" class="diagnostic-step-indicator" data-step-indicator="3" disabled data-astro-cid-ifa5x7jz><span class="step-num" data-astro-cid-ifa5x7jz>03</span><span class="step-label" data-astro-cid-ifa5x7jz>Possible route</span></button></nav><!-- Live Announcement Area for Screen Readers --><div class="visually-hidden" aria-live="polite" data-diagnostic-announce data-astro-cid-ifa5x7jz></div><!-- Step 1: Area of friction --><div class="diagnostic-panel" data-step-panel="1" data-astro-cid-ifa5x7jz><h3 class="diagnostic-prompt" tabindex="-1" data-astro-cid-ifa5x7jz>Step 1: Where does the main friction or uncertainty appear?</h3><div class="diagnostic-options" role="group" aria-label="Select problem area" data-astro-cid-ifa5x7jz><button type="button" class="diagnostic-choice" data-friction="systems" data-astro-cid-ifa5x7jz><span class="choice-tag" data-astro-cid-ifa5x7jz>01 · Business systems</span><strong data-astro-cid-ifa5x7jz>Manual work &amp; disconnected tools</strong><p data-astro-cid-ifa5x7jz>Teams copy data across spreadsheets, emails and legacy databases. Reporting is slow or unreliable.</p></button><button type="button" class="diagnostic-choice" data-friction="digital" data-astro-cid-ifa5x7jz><span class="choice-tag" data-astro-cid-ifa5x7jz>02 · Digital products</span><strong data-astro-cid-ifa5x7jz>A website or customer portal underperforming</strong><p data-astro-cid-ifa5x7jz>Customer, client or member journeys are clumsy, slow, difficult to manage or hard to measure.</p></button><button type="button" class="diagnostic-choice" data-friction="operations" data-astro-cid-ifa5x7jz><span class="choice-tag" data-astro-cid-ifa5x7jz>03 · Cloud &amp; IT operations</span><strong data-astro-cid-ifa5x7jz>Technology operations that feel uncertain</strong><p data-astro-cid-ifa5x7jz>Unclear server resilience, untested backups, recurring incidents or confusing cloud infrastructure costs.</p></button></div></div><!-- Step 2: Current setup (populated dynamically) --><div class="diagnostic-panel" data-step-panel="2" hidden data-astro-cid-ifa5x7jz><h3 class="diagnostic-prompt" tabindex="-1" data-astro-cid-ifa5x7jz>Step 2: What is your current technical foundation?</h3><div class="diagnostic-options" data-setup-options role="group" aria-label="Select current setup" data-astro-cid-ifa5x7jz><!-- Dynamically inserted by JS --></div><div class="diagnostic-actions" data-astro-cid-ifa5x7jz><button type="button" class="button button--secondary button--sm" data-action="back" data-astro-cid-ifa5x7jz>← Change area</button></div></div><!-- Step 3: Recommendation result --><div class="diagnostic-panel" data-step-panel="3" hidden data-astro-cid-ifa5x7jz><div class="diagnostic-result" data-result-container data-astro-cid-ifa5x7jz><div class="result-badge" data-astro-cid-ifa5x7jz>Suggested Next Step</div><h3 class="result-title" data-result-title tabindex="-1" data-astro-cid-ifa5x7jz>Recommended starting point</h3><p class="result-summary" data-result-summary data-astro-cid-ifa5x7jz></p><div class="result-breakdown" data-astro-cid-ifa5x7jz><div class="result-box" data-astro-cid-ifa5x7jz><span class="result-box__label" data-astro-cid-ifa5x7jz>What to review</span><p data-result-step data-astro-cid-ifa5x7jz></p></div><div class="result-box" data-astro-cid-ifa5x7jz><span class="result-box__label" data-astro-cid-ifa5x7jz>Before deciding</span><p data-result-avoid data-astro-cid-ifa5x7jz></p></div></div><p class="result-disclaimer" data-astro-cid-ifa5x7jz>This is a starting point based on your choices. We need to understand your systems, constraints and goals before recommending a solution.</p><div class="result-cta-row" data-astro-cid-ifa5x7jz><a class="button button--primary" href="/contact/" data-result-link data-astro-cid-ifa5x7jz>Discuss your project</a><button type="button" class="button button--secondary" data-action="restart" data-astro-cid-ifa5x7jz>Start again</button></div></div></div></div></div></section><script type="module" src="/_astro/ProblemDiagnostic.astro_astro_type_script_index_0_lang.D7Z4G84q.js"></script><section class="capability-section" aria-labelledby="capabilities-title"><div class="shell capability-shell"><div class="capability-intro"><p class="eyebrow">A wider practical toolkit</p><h2 id="capabilities-title">The right mix of skills, kept inside a clear scope.</h2><p>From a focused repair to a connected digital service, NovaDot can bring software, cloud, data and operational capability together without forcing every problem into a custom build.</p><p class="partner-note"><span aria-hidden="true">•</span> Odoo implementation experience across configuration, customisation, integration, migration and support.</p></div><div class="capability-grid"><article class="capability-item"><span>01</span><div><h3>Custom software</h3><p>Defined tools and applications for workflows that supported products cannot cover cleanly.</p></div></article><article class="capability-item"><span>02</span><div><h3>Websites &amp; digital products</h3><p>Maintainable websites, portals and mobile-first journeys with clearer content and performance.</p></div></article><article class="capability-item"><span>03</span><div><h3>CRM, ERP &amp; Odoo</h3><p>Implementation, configuration, customisation, integration, migration, reporting and support.</p></div></article><article class="capability-item"><span>04</span><div><h3>AI &amp; workflow automation</h3><p>Bounded uses of automation and AI that remove repeat work while keeping decisions accountable.</p></div></article><article class="capability-item"><span>05</span><div><h3>Cloud &amp; resilience</h3><p>Cloud readiness, migration, hosting, backup, recovery and operational improvement.</p></div></article><article class="capability-item"><span>06</span><div><h3>Data &amp; integration</h3><p>Migration, reconciliation and connections that help systems and teams work from reliable information.</p></div></article><article class="capability-item"><span>07</span><div><h3>Application support</h3><p>Structured takeover, stabilisation, maintenance and improvement for technology already in use.</p></div></article><article class="capability-item"><span>08</span><div><h3>Accessibility</h3><p>Practical improvements that make digital services clearer and more usable for more people.</p></div></article></div></div></section><section class="strategy-section" id="process" aria-labelledby="process-title"><div class="shell"><div class="strategy-heading"><p class="eyebrow">How NovaDot works</p><h2 id="process-title">From initial review to supported change.</h2><p>Clear decisions come before delivery. Every stage makes scope, ownership and the next step easier to see.</p></div><div class="strategy-layout"><aside class="decision-panel" aria-labelledby="decision-title"><span class="decision-panel__label">Decision before delivery</span><h3 id="decision-title">The answer is not always “build something new”.</h3><p>We compare the smallest responsible routes first.</p><ol><li><span>01</span>Repair or improve what exists</li><li><span>02</span>Configure or buy a supported product</li><li><span>03</span>Integrate or build a defined gap</li><li><span>04</span>Replace or migrate when justified</li><li><span>05</span>Refer when specialist assurance is the safer route</li></ol></aside><ol class="process-grid"><li class="process-card"><span>01</span><h3>Understand the need</h3><p>We review your goals, the current setup, the people affected and any constraints to agree what to prioritise.</p></li><li class="process-card"><span>02</span><h3>Compare the options</h3><p>We evaluate repairing what exists, configuring supported products, integrating systems or commissioning custom work.</p></li><li class="process-card"><span>03</span><h3>Agree the scope</h3><p>Before work starts, we agree deliverables, dependencies, responsibilities, acceptance checks, ownership and handover.</p></li><li class="process-card"><span>04</span><h3>Deliver, hand over and support</h3><p>We deliver controlled increments, agree release and handover checks, and establish defined ongoing support expectations.</p></li></ol></div><div class="strategy-actions"><a class="button button--secondary strategy-link" href="/how-we-work/">See the delivery approach</a><p class="strategy-commercial-note">We agree scope, deliverables and any assessment fee before starting. <a class="text-link" href="/how-we-work/#commercial-terms">Learn about our commercial terms &rarr;</a></p></div></div></section><section class="section audience-section" aria-labelledby="audience-title"><div class="shell"><div class="section-heading-grid"><div><p class="eyebrow">Built around real organisations</p><h2 id="audience-title">Built for the way your organisation works.</h2></div><div class="section-heading__aside"><p>NovaDot can support growing businesses, membership and community organisations, public-facing teams and operations where joined-up systems matter.</p></div></div><div class="audience-grid"><article><span>01</span><h3>Growing organisations</h3><p>For teams moving beyond spreadsheets, manual hand-offs or systems that no longer fit the work.</p></article><article><span>02</span><h3>Membership &amp; community teams</h3><p>For organisations managing people, payments, content, events or services across a connected digital journey.</p></article><article><span>03</span><h3>Public &amp; service-focused teams</h3><p>For accountable work that needs clear scope, accessibility, documentation and handover.</p></article><article><span>04</span><h3>Operations-heavy businesses</h3><p>For organisations where orders, stock, data, field work or customer service depend on joined-up systems.</p></article></div><div class="company-card" id="about"><div class="company-card__copy"><p class="eyebrow">NovaDot Ltd</p><h2>A UK technology company with a deliberately practical model.</h2><p>NOVADOT LTD is an active private limited company registered in England and Wales. It was incorporated in 2011 and works across software, digital products, business systems, cloud, data, automation and ongoing support.</p><a class="text-link" href="/about/">More about NovaDot</a></div><dl class="company-facts"><div><dt>Company number</dt><dd>07691369</dd></div><div><dt>Incorporated</dt><dd>4 July 2011</dd></div><div><dt>Office address</dt><dd>First Floor, 18B Tithe Street, Leicester, LE5 4BN</dd></div><div><dt>Registered office</dt><dd>21 Berkeley Close, Oadby, Leicester, England, LE2 4SZ</dd></div><div><dt>Jurisdiction</dt><dd>England and Wales</dd></div></dl></div></div></section><section class="section faq-section" aria-labelledby="faq-title"><div class="shell faq-layout"><div class="faq-intro"><p class="eyebrow">Questions, answered plainly</p><h2 id="faq-title">A clearer starting point.</h2><p>You do not need a finished brief or a preferred technology before getting in touch.</p></div><div class="faq-list"><details><summary><span>01</span>What can NovaDot help with?</summary><p>NovaDot works across custom software, websites and digital products, CRM and ERP, Odoo, cloud, data integration, workflow automation and ongoing application support. We begin with the business problem and narrow the scope from there.</p></details><details><summary><span>02</span>Can you improve a system that is already in use?</summary><p>Yes. A focused review can identify what should be stabilised, repaired, integrated or improved before replacement is considered. The aim is to retain useful capability and change only what is justified.</p></details><details><summary><span>03</span>How does a project start?</summary><p>We start with your goals, the current workflow or system, who it affects, the available evidence and the consequence of the problem. From there we can define the decision, inputs, responsibilities and a proportionate next step.</p></details><details><summary><span>04</span>Do you provide ongoing support?</summary><p>Support can include maintenance, monitoring, managed improvements and structured handover. Coverage, response expectations, ownership and exit arrangements are agreed explicitly rather than assumed.</p></details><details><summary><span>05</span>How do you manage releases and handover?</summary><p>Delivery planning can include controlled changes, backups, rollback, acceptance checks, documentation and knowledge transfer. The exact controls depend on the system, risk and agreed scope.</p></details></div></div></section><section class="closing-cta"><svg class="arc-graphic arc-graphic--compact closing-cta__arc" viewBox="0 0 620 620" fill="none" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false"><g stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.25"><path d="M598 76C400 76 238 184 238 316s162 228 360 228" opacity=".16"></path><path d="M598 116C426 116 286 205 286 316s140 188 312 188" opacity=".24"></path><path d="M598 158C454 158 337 228 337 316s117 146 261 146" opacity=".38"></path><path d="M598 201C485 201 392 252 392 316s93 103 206 103" opacity=".62"></path><path d="M598 245C516 245 448 277 448 316s68 60 150 60"></path><path d="M83 316H448" opacity=".5"></path></g><circle cx="448" cy="316" r="7" fill="currentColor"></circle></svg><div class="shell closing-cta__inner"><h2>Tell us what you want to improve.</h2><p>Describe the workflow, system or digital journey that needs work. We can review what is happening, compare the options and agree a practical next step.</p><a class="button button--primary" href="/contact/">Discuss your project</a></div></section></main><footer class="site-footer" data-astro-cid-nns7i3if><div class="shell footer-grid" data-astro-cid-nns7i3if><div class="footer-brand" data-astro-cid-nns7i3if><a class="brand-link" href="/" aria-label="NovaDot home" data-astro-cid-nns7i3if><img class="brand-logo" src="/brand/novadot-full-logo-dark-theme.png" srcset="/brand/novadot-full-logo-dark-theme.png 1x, /brand/novadot-full-logo-dark-theme-2x.png 2x" width="720" height="280" alt="NovaDot" data-astro-cid-nns7i3if></a><p data-astro-cid-nns7i3if>NovaDot helps UK organisations plan, build, improve and support software, systems and digital services.</p></div><div class="footer-links" data-astro-cid-nns7i3if><div data-astro-cid-nns7i3if><h2 data-astro-cid-nns7i3if>Work</h2><a href="/services/" data-astro-cid-nns7i3if>Services</a></div><div data-astro-cid-nns7i3if><h2 data-astro-cid-nns7i3if>Company</h2><a href="/events/" data-astro-cid-nns7i3if>Events &amp; Space</a><a href="/how-we-work/" data-astro-cid-nns7i3if>How We Work</a><a href="/about/" data-astro-cid-nns7i3if>About</a></div><div data-astro-cid-nns7i3if><h2 data-astro-cid-nns7i3if>Contact</h2><a href="/contact/" data-astro-cid-nns7i3if>Contact</a></div><div data-astro-cid-nns7i3if><h2 data-astro-cid-nns7i3if>Legal</h2><a href="/privacy-policy/" data-astro-cid-nns7i3if>Privacy Policy</a><a href="/terms/" data-astro-cid-nns7i3if>Terms</a></div></div></div><div class="shell footer-legal" data-astro-cid-nns7i3if><p data-astro-cid-nns7i3if>© 2026 NOVADOT LTD. Registered in England and Wales. Company number 07691369.</p></div></footer></body></html>